OL,3,GNEWSANew rules for under-18s after fans
OL,4,Ahit by stones
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football boss says it has implemented
OL,7,Fnew rules for under 18's after recent
OL,8,Fincidents of violence at matches.
OL,10,FGloucester City AFC said it was
OL,11,Fconcerned for the safety of its
OL,12,Fsupporters following the away match
OL,13,Fagainst Redditch United on Saturday.
OL,15,FRedditch United chairman David Faulkner
OL,16,Fsaid more than 50 youths, who were
OL,17,Fturned away from the stadium, threw
OL,18,Frocks at Gloucester fans while they
OL,19,Fwere leaving.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
