OL,3,GNEWSANew rules for under-18s after fans
OL,4,Ahit by stones
OL,5,
OL,6,FFaulkner said it was not an isolated
OL,7,Fincident, with a similar situation
OL,8,Fhappening in August, and he believed it
OL,9,Fstems from a social media trend.
